<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug kerosene output up 22.67 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug kerosene output up 22.67 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 3.43 million tonnes of kerosene in the first eight months of 1996, an increase of 22.67 percent from the same period of last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Kerosene output in August alone was 457,000 tonnes, it said.</p>
</text>
